      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm having one of those crazy migraines again. it hit me super fast, like in like 5 seconds it just went from zero to the worst pain ive ever felt. i feel a bit nauseous too. i usually just take my sumatriptan when this happens, is it okay to just take a double dose this time to get ahead of it because it's so bad?",
